Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.88,0:06:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这位 "变态人"   一直盯着她看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because "Pervie Perverson" over here can't stop staring at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.97,0:06:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  钱德  她是我们的表妹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?! Chandler, she's our cousin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.43,0:06:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有盯着她看  我只是在专心倾听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wasn't staring at her. Okay? I was just listening intently.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.64,0:06:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做一位好的聊天者  看着我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's called being a good conversationalist. Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.31,0:06:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看着南面8英寸以外的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were staring about eight inches south of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.32,0:06:59.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  她可以来我家住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine. She can stay at my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.78,0:07:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,顺便问下  凯西现在长成什么样子了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}By the way, what-what does Cassie even look like now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.24,0:07:04.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像玛丽莲阿姨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She looks exactly like Aunt Marilyn. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.95,0:07:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽莲阿姨会来参加婚礼吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So this Aunt Marilyn, is she coming to the wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.08,0:07:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别惹我发火\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wafer-thin ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.67,0:07:16.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我要不要再演一遍那场戏啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, so, will I be reading the same scene again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.38,0:07:24.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实  我们本来要打电话给你  你今天不用来这儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, I tried to call you. You didn't need to come today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.80,0:07:26.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.51,0:07:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会是这个角色的最佳人选  不过随你便\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know I'd have been perfect for this part. but whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.02,0:07:33.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你们做了个错误的决定  这会毁了你们的电影  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, thanks for making a bad decision and ruined your movie. Good day!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.73,0:07:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  乔伊  你不需要来这儿  因为导演昨天看了你的带子非常喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait Joey! You didn't need to come down because the director saw your tape from yesterday and loved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.07,0:07:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下台鞠躬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.20,0:07:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呀  很好玩吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh? Wasn't that fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.62,0:07:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即席表演\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We did a little improv there. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.12,0:07:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才在说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, you-You were saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.00,0:07:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,导演们认为你很适合  明天想见你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, the director thinks you're really right for the part and wants to meet you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.83,0:07:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  当然  太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. Sure. That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.17,0:08:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的经纪人说你对裸戏没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh and your agent said you're okay with the nudity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.63,0:08:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  没错  只要是看着很有格调\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah! Yeah, sure. just long as it's handled tastefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.76,0:08:06.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且谷仓里不要太冷就行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that barn is not too cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.43,0:08:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了  还有一件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Terrific. Well, uh, there's one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.85,0:08:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,导演希望电影里  每一样东西都看上去真实可信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh... Uh, it's really important to the director that everything in this movie is authentic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.02,0:08:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你和莎拉的性爱场面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah and so in your love scene with Sarah...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.78,0:08:24.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说她从没见过  非犹太人的裸体男子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...she talks about how she's never seen a naked man who wasn't Jewish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.11,0:08:26.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.12,0:08:35.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,导演坚持演出这个角色的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, uh, well, the director is insisting that whoever play that part...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.08,0:08:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,必须是从解剖学角度上来看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...be authentically, uh, anatomically...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.13,0:08:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是个犹太人  你知道我在说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...not Jewish. You know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.05,0:08:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.09,0:08:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  你说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.97,0:08:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在那时的意大利  一个天主教移民应该没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}An Italian Catholic immigrant at this time would not be...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.60,0:08:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,割包皮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bar mitzvah-ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.06,0:09:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么说要得到这个角色  你就不能割过那个  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So to get this part you can't be-Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.90,0:09:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可你其实割了  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you are? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.11,0:09:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你告诉他们  你没有割过  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you told them you weren't? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.61,0:09:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇啊  哇啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.57,0:09:13.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那这就全完了  没有什么可努力的余地了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it's definitely all gone? There's nothing there to work with?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在想什么  我不知道  我想得到这个角色\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What were you thinking? I don't know. I really want this part.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他们说不管试镜时问什么  都回答是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And they tell you no matter what you get asked at an audition you say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.30,0:09:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果要你骑马  你就说会骑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like if-if they want you to ride a horse, you tell 'em you can
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回头再去学\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And just figure out how to do it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.47,0:09:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  这和学会骑马不一样  这就像是学习如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey! This is not like learning to ride a horse. This is like learning to...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.81,0:09:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让衣服自己长出衣领来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...grow a turtleneck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:50.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我知道  行了吗  明天我去见导演时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, I know! okay? And apparently tomorrow, when I go in to meet the director...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.32,0:09:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,必须脱掉衣服  让他们检查我的身子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I have to take off my clothes so  that they can see what my body looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.99,0:09:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天  那你怎么办啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:10:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来我必须打给我的经纪人  告诉她我没法演\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just have to call my agent and tell her I can't do the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.63,0:10:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unless what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.84,0:10:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这听起来可能有些疯狂  不过我们也许可以做点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, this may sound crazy, but there may be something we could...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:12.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,造型\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.47,0:10:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像什么  我还没想好  不过  嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like what? Well, I'm not sure yet, but, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.81,0:10:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我突然有个念头  我在想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...off the top of my head, I'm thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:26.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用双面胶和某一些午餐肉来做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...double-sided tape and some sort of luncheon meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.62,0:10:37.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我有个派对主题的好点子了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! I've got a great idea for party favors for the shower. Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们找点桃木盒子  刻上每个人的名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we get some uh mahogany boxes and carve everyone's names in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.71,0:10:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在里面放着每个人的出生石\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and inside is everyone's individual birth stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.17,0:10:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.05,0:10:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那你负责这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, you take care of that. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.39,0:10:58.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有  派对就在明天  我们还没有宾客名单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And meanwhile, the party's tomorrow and we still don't have a guest list.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.06,0:11:03.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  好吧  我们知道谁会来  有我  你要来吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Okay! Well okay, Who do we know that's coming? Me. Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.02,0:11:08.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  怎么样啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey, what's up Mon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.69,0:11:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在替乔伊弄点东西  可以搜一下你的冰箱吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well uh, I'm trying to making something for Joey. Do you mind if I raid your fridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.57,0:11:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请便\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.37,0:11:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  火鸡肉  没用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. All right. Turkey? Mm, that won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起司  没用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cheese? That won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.37,0:11:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,橄榄面包  希望这没用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Olive loaf? I hope that won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在替他做三明治吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you making him a sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  像是鸡肉卷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it's, um, more like a wrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.93,0:11:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我要走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so, um, I'm gonna go, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.10,0:11:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以继续讨论  要送我什么礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess you can get back to deciding on what to get me for a present!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.86,0:11:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要送她礼物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have to get her a present?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.11,0:11:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  看我拿到什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, but look. Look at what I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:55.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的通讯录  我们有宾客名单了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's her address book. We have a guest list.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.49,0:12:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你好厉害  你从她皮包里拿的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh my God you're amazing. Did you pull that out of her purse?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.00,0:12:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  还有一点派对的启动资金\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh. And a little seed money for the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.59,0:12:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cassie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.59,0:12:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  罗斯  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Ross. Hi. ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.26,0:12:20.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好久不见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's been so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.68,0:12:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上一次我看到你时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Last time I saw you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.48,0:12:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你正忙着收帐篷好去看绝地武士\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you were setting up your tent in line to see Return of the Jedi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.31,0:12:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Oh, uh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.81,0:12:33.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么说你那天看见我了  我还以为你没看见呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So-so you did see me that day. Because it seemed like you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.74,0:12:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  没关系  来来  请进\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, sorry about that. It's okay. Come, come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.45,0:12:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你让我住在这儿  我是说摩妮卡那儿也不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks for letting me stay here. I mean Monica's place was nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.66,0:12:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是她的未婚夫老是盯着我看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But her fiancee sure stares a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.65,0:13:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天  你学钱德学得真像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! You do a great Chandler!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.57,0:13:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很会模仿别人表情的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh. Yeah, I have a knack for impressions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许等我们熟一点  你也可以学我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, maybe after we get re-acquainted, uh, you could do me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.66,0:13:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.71,0:13:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯西  你的 你的好吃吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cassie, how you--? How you doing on that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.34,0:13:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,热狗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}hot dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.39,0:13:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我吃完了  感谢上帝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm all done. Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.81,0:13:49.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得我们最后一次见面  是我们父母一起租下那栋海滨别墅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess the last time we really hung out was when our parents rented that beach house together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.85,0:13:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  对  没错  记得那时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, right, right. Ooh, remember the time...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:55.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把你按倒在地   搔你痒把你咯吱哭了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...l, uh, pinned you down and tickled you until you cried?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.53,0:14:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在大了  不能那么做了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're probably too old to do that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.87,0:14:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都记得那个夏天  我就是那时长了这些雀斑的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll always remember that summer. because it's when I got all of these freckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.21,0:14:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯哼  还有  我也一直都记得那个夏天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh! Uh-huh! And-And I'll always remember that summer...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.71,0:14:17.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为那时我才意识到我们是亲戚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because that's when I realized that we are related.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.80,0:14:19.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你长那么大才明白过来啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It took you that long to figure it out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.93,0:14:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是有点反应慢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well I'm, I'm a little slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.93,0:14:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像我们的孩子也可能会这样子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just as our children would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.69,0:14:34.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗  好  嗨  谢谢大家能来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How are you? Good. Hi. Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.74,0:14:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  很高兴见到你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, thank you. Thank you. No? All right. Oh, it's so nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.82,0:14:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  谢谢  好  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, thanks. Okay. Hey, Rash?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.91,0:14:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是  这些是什么人啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah? Who the hell are all these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.29,0:14:50.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  我打给摩尼卡本子里的每一个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. I called all the people in Monica's phone book
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.25,0:14:53.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些都是通知到能在24小时内赶来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and these are the only ones who could show up on 24 hours notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道有另一个词来形容这些人吗  输家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hmm, y'know there's another word for people like that: Losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.09,0:15:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  我是瑞秋  这是菲比  我是伴娘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, I'm Rachel. This is Phoebe. I'm the maid of honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.68,0:15:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么认识摩妮卡的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do you know Monica?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.97,0:15:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是她四年前的会计师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was her accountant four years ago. Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很想知道  这过去四年是谁替她报税的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm very interested to find out who's been doing her taxes the last four years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.77,0:15:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.77,0:15:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡何时会到  我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what time is Monica supposed to get here? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.99,0:15:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请稍等片刻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse us for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.41,0:15:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没通知她来  是该你通知她的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You didn't tell her to come?! You were supposed to tell her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.41,0:15:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不该我  是你该通知她来的  而我负责带蛋糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No I wasn't! You were supposed to tell her to come! I was supposed to bringing the cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.46,0:15:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我打电话给她  对  然后要她带蛋糕来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine, I'll go call her. Yes! And please tell her to bring a cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们有很多选择  有几个模型你可以试戴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, we have a lot of options here, A number of prototypes for you to try on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:48.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  看起来很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, those look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.14,0:15:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  这个蘑菇的伞做的头  这个是用意大利香肠做的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah! Okay, this one's a mushroom cap. Uh, this one is made of bologna.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.14,0:15:56.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有  还有牙签  只是撑着等胶水干掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And-And the toothpicks? Oh, just until the glue dries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.11,0:15:58.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感谢上帝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.03,0:16:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些比较逼真  不过容易腐烂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, these are-are more realistic, but perishable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.53,0:16:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这儿  粉红色的山羊皮  很不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? Over here, we have pink suede, which is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.03,0:16:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过  湿了就会缩水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But umm, if it gets wet, then you know it'll shrink.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把这个拿走好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well maybe we'll just take that one away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.37,0:16:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也做了一个有毛的  不过那是给我自己的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I also did a little something in fur, but, uh, that's really just for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.96,0:16:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么  你干吗不进屋去试试这些玩意  我们就知道哪些有用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. So, why don't you go into your room and try these on? We'll get a better idea of what's gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.59,0:16:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  你真是位好朋友  这事太诡异了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks, you are such a good friend. And this is so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.23,0:16:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,牙签  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Toothpick? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.73,0:16:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在在试那个  水果卷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you trying now? The Fruit Roll-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.36,0:16:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样  很好吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And? Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.95,0:16:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.16,0:16:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  等一下  有个合适的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute. Wait a minute. We have a winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.66,0:16:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  哪一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.29,0:16:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,泥彩蛋  现在没那么傻了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The Silly Putty. It's not so silly anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.47,0:17:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是你表妹  她是你表妹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's your cousin. She's your cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.97,0:17:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果她知道你脑袋里在想什么  她会以为你有病\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If she knew what was going on in your head, she'd think you were sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.44,0:17:28.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会吗  让我们回顾一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or would she? Let's back up for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.66,0:17:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是她提议开红酒的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She was the one who suggested opening a bottle of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.74,0:17:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是她把灯光调暗的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She was the one who turned down the lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是她要租《二十三世纪大逃亡》的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She was the one that wanted to rent Logan's Run...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.79,0:17:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有史以来最性感的电影\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...the sexiest movie ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.26,0:17:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这眼神\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I know that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.43,0:17:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管了  我想要  她想要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Forget it. I want it. She wants it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.97,0:17:56.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要行动了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.40,0:18:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.86,0:18:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说点机智的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Say something clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.99,0:18:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  不必机智的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, doesn't have to be clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.37,0:18:19.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要说点什么  说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it just has to be words. Say some words.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么话都好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Any words will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.75,0:18:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天  这是有史以来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, this is the longest...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.63,0:18:32.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最长的沉默\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that anyone has not talked ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.01,0:18:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说什么都比这样强啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There is nothing you can say to make this worse...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.81,0:18:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说就是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so just say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.27,0:18:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很久没做爱了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I haven't had sex in a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.65,0:18:52.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还不如不说话的好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you really shouldn't have said anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.24,0:18:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  瑞秋  是摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe? Rachel? It's Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.58,0:19:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事这么急着找我来呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wonder what you could possibly need me for on such short notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.13,0:19:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.55,0:19:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  我们很抱歉  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Monica. We are so sorry. For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.51,0:19:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,第一   忘了替你办告别单身女子派对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well first, for forgetting to throw you a bridal shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.55,0:19:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且还忘了邀请你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then for forgetting to invite you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.43,0:19:20.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们已经办完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You already had it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.10,0:19:24.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们打电话给你通讯录里每一个人  来了很多人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Well, we called everyone in your phone book. A bunch of people came.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.61,0:19:27.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找你花了好久的时间  客人都走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but it took us so long to get you here that they had to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.82,0:19:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我们本想给你一个大惊喜  替你办一个大的告别单身女子派对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, we wanted to throw you a big surprise and a great shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:35.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在两个都没了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and now you don't have either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.41,0:19:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们全搞砸了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We ruined everything. Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.03,0:19:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  等一下  没有搞砸  你们做的非常好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well no, wait a minute, that's not true. No, what did, that was really sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.04,0:19:45.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实这样子最好  什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it kind of works out for the best, heh. What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.71,0:19:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在要和我真正喜欢的人一起共渡我的告别单身女子派对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well now, I get to spend my shower with the only people I really love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.46,0:19:55.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我收了所有的礼物  而不必和我不喜欢的人说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I get all those presents without talking to people I don't even like!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.18,0:20:03.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惊喜  惊喜  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Surprise. Surprise, Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.65,0:20:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最酷的是  这个角色是从尼泊尔来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And what's cool is, the character is from Naples, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.07,0:20:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我全家都是从尼泊尔来的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. My whole family's from Naples.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.07,0:20:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  我听得差不多了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh that's great. Okay. well I've heard everything I need to hear...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.50,0:20:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只需要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We just need to, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.67,0:20:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,莱斯莉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Leslie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.25,0:20:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  这有点怪怪的  是  没有问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Joey, this is the awkward part. Oh, hey, right. Not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.50,0:20:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全了解\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I totally understand you need to...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.42,0:20:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们需要知道我没有什么吓人的疤痕或纹身\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...y'know make sure I don't have any horrible scars or tattoos.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.22,0:20:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.26,0:20:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没什么可隐瞒的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have nothing to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.02,0:20:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看这儿  这就是我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, there you go. That's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,百分之百纯天然的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One hundred-percent natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.20,0:21:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你们说  这事以前从没发生过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I tell you, that has never happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.21,0:21:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯西  在这儿都还好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cassie, are you finding everything okay in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.72,0:21:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你让我住这儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Thank you so much for letting me stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.68,0:21:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题  喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, it's no problem. I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.07,0:21:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.70,0:21:44.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说话啊  随便说点什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Say something. Say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.75,0:21:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,约她出去  她又不是你表妹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ask her out! She's not your cousin!
